      "unordered": [
        {
          "text": "**The Cosmic Web:** Investigating the large-scale structure of the universe, which acts as the \"environment\" that dictates where galaxies form and how they are fed.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 92,
          "source": "topic-set-conceptual-guide-to-galactic-structure-🆔20251106223718.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Stellar Populations:** Exploring the idea that stars come in different \"generations\" (Population I, II, and III) and how their chemical makeup tells a story about the galaxy's age and history.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 92,
          "source": "topic-set-conceptual-guide-to-galactic-structure-🆔20251106223718.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Active Galactic Nuclei (AGN) and Quasars:** A deeper dive into the most extreme examples of supermassive black hole activity, focusing on their observational properties and profound impact on their surroundings.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 94,
          "source": "topic-set-conceptual-guide-to-galactic-structure-🆔20251106223718.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The Hubble Deep Fields:** An inquiry into the *observational* side, focusing on what we learned from pointing a telescope at an \"empty\" patch of sky and finding thousands of distant, ancient galaxies.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 97,
          "source": "topic-set-conceptual-guide-to-galactic-structure-🆔20251106223718.md"
        }
      ]
    },
